ards the Arabic Language and Literature through the teaching and learning of classical, modern, Indo-Arabic Literature (Prose and Poetry), History of Contemporary Arab World, grammar and functional Arabic etc.\nVision:\nThe vision of the Department is to becoming a nation icon making use of the power and potentials of Arabic Language and literature adhering strictly to the motto that virtue lies in immaculate actions. The another vision of this Department is to impart deep knowledge of Arabic language, Literature and Culture of the Arab World in order to strength the Indo-Arab relations.\nFaculty Members\nDr. Ashraful Alom\nAssistant Professor\nview details\nDr. Abdur Rahman Mullah\nAssistant Professor\nview details\nDr. Farhad Hussain\nAssistant Professor\nview details\nDharmasala College,Dharmoshala Pt.III, Dhubri, Assam - 783324\n9577051661\ndharmasala.college175@gmail.com\nUseful Links\nGauhati University\nNAAC\nUGC\nAHSEC\nQuick Links\nAbout Us\nOnline Admission\nContact Us\nGoverning Body\nOpening Hours\nMon - Sat :\n9.00 am - 5.30 pm\nSunday :\nClosed\nCopyright ©2023. All Rights Reserved\n#JEET", "links": [{"label": "Apply Leave", "url": "https://www.dharmasalacollege.com/leave/faculty"}, {"label": "Feedback System", "url": "https://www.dharmasalacollege.com/department.php?d_id=7"}, {"label": "Inst. Distinctiveness", "url": "https://www.dharmasalacollege.com/pdf/Institutional_Distinctiveness.pdf"}, {"label": "RTI Declaration", "url": "https://www.dharmasalacollege.com/pdf/RTI.pdf"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://www.dharmasalacollege.com/department.php?d_id=7"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://www.dharmasalacollege.com/department.php?d_id=7"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://www.dharmasalacollege.com/department.php?d_id=7"}, {"label": "", "url": "javascript:void(0)"}, {"label": "Contact us!", "url": "https://www.dharmasalacollege.com/department.php?d_id=7"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://www.dharmasalacollege.com/pdf/C-17340_certificate.pdf"}, {"label": "AISHE I